      "section_title": "12 常见问题汇总",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "数据采集器对外通讯端口类型有哪几种，对应的端口名称是什么，对应的参数设置如何设\n置？",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        144.156,
        453.366,
        165.909
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-0FF7950943F47041",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
